---
import { AMAZON_URL } from "@/consts";

---

<section id="precio" aria-labelledby="precio-title" class="section-y border-t border-line">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="frame crop crop-lg grid gap-1.5 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]">
			<div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 border border-line bg-panel/70">
				<div class="border-b border-line bg-linear-to-r from-sheet via-sheet/90 to-panel px-6 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-12">
					<h2 id="precio-title" class="heading-section">
						¿Cuál será
						<span class="serif">
							tu <span class="ink-fade">color?</span>
						</span>
					</h2>
				</div>

				<div class="grid gap-8 px-6 sm:px-8 md:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
						<span class="label">Precio orientativo</span>
						<p class="m-0 font-display leading-none font-extralight tracking-[-0.04em]">
							<span class="block text-base font-normal tracking-normal text-graphite">desde</span>
							<span class="whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(2.6rem,4.6vw,3.6rem)]">30.000 $</span>
						</p>
					</div>
					<p class="m-0 self-end text-sm text-graphite">
						Precio de partida sugerido fuera de la beta, por implante. El importe final se confirma en consulta. Los impuestos varían según el estado.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-line px-6 py-6 sm:px-8">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-5">
						<a href="#beta" class="btn btn-primary crop max-sm:w-full">
							Únete a la beta
						</a>
						<a role="link" href={AMAZON_URL}  target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Comprar el libro en Amazon" aria-disabled="true" title="Enlace a Amazon" class="btn btn-quiet crop max-sm:w-full cursor-pointer hover:bg-panel/50">
							Reservar consulta
						</a>
					</div>
					<p class="note m-0">Gratis durante la beta solo para clientes habituales ya inscritos, hasta el 20 de septiembre de 2033.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<figure class="relative m-0 grid min-h-80 place-items-center border border-line bg-sheet px-6 py-16 max-lg:hidden">
				<div class="flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-8">
					<h3 class="m-0 flex flex-col gap-1">
						<span class="font-display text-[2.75rem] leading-none font-extralight tracking-[-0.03em]">Ficha del</span>
						<span class="font-serif text-[3.25rem] leading-none font-medium font-stretch-[87.5%]">implante</span>
					</h3>
					<dl class="m-0 flex flex-col border-t border-line">
						<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line py-3">
							<dt class="font-labels text-[0.6875rem] text-muted">LENTE</dt>
							<dd class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem]">1 ojo</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line py-3">
							<dt class="font-labels text-[0.6875rem] text-muted">AURA</dt>
							<dd class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem]">Solo la ve el portador</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line py-3">
							<dt class="font-labels text-[0.6875rem] text-muted">COLORES REGISTRADOS</dt>
							<dd class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.9375rem]">
								<span class="size-3 bg-aura-orange" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span class="size-3 bg-aura-blue" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span class="size-3 border border-dashed border-faint" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								2 de ?
							</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line py-3">
							<dt class="font-labels text-[0.6875rem] text-muted">LANZAMIENTO</dt>
							<dd class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem]">03.10.2033</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line py-3">
							<dt class="font-labels text-[0.6875rem] text-muted">TU COLOR</dt>
							<dd class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-muted">Sin registrar</dd>
						</div>
					</dl>
				</div>
				<figcaption class="contents">
					<span class="chip absolute top-4 left-4">
						<b>ID</b> TC-2033-1003
					</span>
					<span class="chip absolute right-4 bottom-4">FIG. 02 · LANZAMIENTO 03.10.2033</span>
				</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
